# somecointernational.com: project rules

Site rule for `websites/somecointernational.com/`. It applies in addition to the global rules in `.cursor/rules/`; where they conflict, the global rules win. Paths are relative to the site folder.

## Site shape
- Multi-page equipment brochure from the .NET Core LiteWeb rebuild (MySQL dump + wwwroot), not the older WebForms live site.
- Pages: About, Products (construction / industrial / agriculture trees), News, Services, Contact, Feedback. Home is driven by `data/home.json` (slides, Who We Are, clients carousel from the home page gallery).
- One office: Dora Highway / Medawar, Beirut. Phone `+961 1 576777`, fax `+961 1 561666`, email `info@somecointernational.com`.
- Social: Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn from the dump settings.
- Captcha scopes: `admin-login`, `contact`, `feedback`.
- Import with `npm run import:legacy` (`scripts/import-someco.ts`). The `legacy/` tree is gitignored.

## Design
- Keep the Bootstrap 4 / Owl public template from the rebuild (`public/css/legacy-style.css` plus local Font Awesome, Ionicons, Flaticon). Do not restyle with another site's brochure layout.
- Colours from `wwwroot/images/someco-international-logo.png`: brand blue `#006090` (admin `themeColor` the same), accent `#0099e6`, silver `#b8c0c8`, navy `#005088`. Tokens in `public/scss/_tokens.scss`.
- Fonts: K2D (headings), Niramit (body), self-hosted under `public/fonts/google/`.
